  "rationale": "The target is an OR over dbReplica, codeRepo, shareMount and mailArchive, and several of these have independent routes. codeRepo:collection is reachable via jumpHost:lateralMovement, which has three independent parents: sshKey (from wifiGuest), configSecret (from exposedApi) and vpnSession. codeRepo is also reachable via backupHost:lateralMovement, fed by configSecret or kerberoast. mailArchive:collection is reachable via fileServer:lateralMovement, which comes from browserStore (from phishing) and has other parents too. No single blocked step cuts all of these paths, so no step is a single point of failure."
